      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [
        "move"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within reach of the dragon's tail uses a move action or leaves a square during a move action it's using</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragon makes a tail Strike at the creature with a -2 penalty. If it hits, the dragon disrupts the creature's action.</p>",
